<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He preserved me and arranged my daily walk.</l><l>He patiently works to transform my soul.</l><l>He brought me to the church, the one true flock</l><l>Here we enjoy Him and His name extol.</l><l>Though there were times in the valleys,</l><l>I did not fear for He was with me.</l><l>He used every joy and distress</l><l>To conform and to bless,</l><l>Looking back now I can confess…</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I onward run for I must finish my course,</l><l>As long as He grants me more days to live.</l><l>He supplies me with the grace to be my force.</l><l>He’s always near, full of more life to give.</l><l>There is not much time remaining.</l><l>While I have breath He’s sustaining.</l><l>As I follow Him and don’t stray,</l><l>Then I know in that day</l><l>By His mercy I will still say…</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
